# 2025-03-14 23:39:19.142157
+Change the appearance/layout of the DynamicTable component as follows, ideally using tailwindcss 4.x where possible.
+
+- Show a light red separator/border between each column, including the headings.
+
+- The total width of all the columns should fit/fill the available width of the table/page.
+
+- Resizing the page should grow/shrink the width of the columns appropriately
+
+- Hiding/showing a column should also resize the remaining columns appropriately

