# 2025-03-14 23:57:31.203519
+There are some issues with your solution:
+- No separator/border appears between the columns. Please add a thin, light red column separator running the full height of the table columns, between each column.
+
+- All the added column width when resizing appears to be in just the first column. This results in A LOT of empty leading whitespace in the first column, yet the end of the content string is truncated. 
+
+Adjust so the maximum width of a column does not exceed the maximum width of the content.
+
+Ensure that if the column is sufficiently wide, the content of the column appears in the column cell. This is especially a problem if there is excessive leading whitespace at the start of the cell, yet the content string is truncated at the end.
+
+Currently when the content of a cell/column is a JS Object, there is a nice tooltip that shows the full JSON when hovering over the cell. Please add a similar tooltip to text cells, particularly when the full string is truncated in the cell display.
+
+-

